{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S03、S06、S13的感受描述仍然偏密，尤其S03只有38秒，部分细节可能来不及消化；X在这方面相对留白更多。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更适合边听边扫：短句交替、重点加亮，让观众很快抓住每段在讲什么；感受词按音乐节点出现，也减少了一次面对整堆文字的负担。更重要的是，Y把怀念亲近、想起受气、害怕孤单、不甘心回头、最终学着独自向前的心理因果写得比较清楚，尤其把亲近越鲜活、旧日委屈越容易翻上来的矛盾表达得很准确。音乐感受方面，Y不仅写情绪，还写声音质地、节奏、动作、空间感和身体反应，细节层次明显丰富，最终的情绪转变也更容易被普通观众感受到。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "525883ee-8fed-436d-ac1a-787b99d4c761", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T164554392314Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:47:05.903704+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7d862deeb2e6723f6009e9cd1e5d6d4eaf2e6f4c6b020e3237da92bfc39dc89e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31